                <pb facs="0826" n="778" sameAs="frus:frus1868p1/pg778"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Notification.</hi></head>
                <p>The undersigned hereby publishes for general information the accompanying
                    dispatch received from her Majesty’s minister, relative to the state of
                    insecurity still prevailing at the port of Neegata.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LACHLAN FLETCHER, <hi rendition="#italic">Her Britannic Majesty’s
                            Consul.</hi></signed><lb/><dateline rendition="#float-left"><hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">British Consulate</hi>, <placeName><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Kanagawa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1868-06-25"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi>
                            25, 1868</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
